1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,581
Claude AI aur Claude Code ka har option samajhna hai?

2
00:00:03,641 --> 00:00:05,927
Toh ye tutorial aapke liye hai!

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,454
Sabse pehle Claude AI ka home screen samajhiye.

4
00:00:09,514 --> 00:00:11,948
Yahan se aap nayi chat shuru kar sakte hain,

5
00:00:12,008 --> 00:00:14,363
purani conversations dekh sakte hain

6
00:00:14,423 --> 00:00:17,925
